From a27349d54b7f873d5b5cacc3aae6fd7b7c48f90d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alan Rockefeller <alanrockefeller@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 03:06:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Version 4.0.1-dikarya2

The release tag still printed 4.0.1 (PRE-RELEASE); name the patched build so
that a MrBayes log shows which library ran. MrBayes 3.2.9-dikarya2 computes
chains concurrently only on a BEAGLE whose version says dikarya2 or later,
since an earlier one keeps shared scratch.
---
 libhmsbeagle/beagle.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libhmsbeagle/beagle.cpp b/libhmsbeagle/beagle.cpp
index 4e91d709..fc1e19a3 100644
--- a/libhmsbeagle/beagle.cpp
+++ b/libhmsbeagle/beagle.cpp
@@ -41,7 +41,7 @@
 #include "libhmsbeagle/plugin/Plugin.h"
 #include "beagle.h"
 
-#define BEAGLE_VERSION  PACKAGE_VERSION  " (PRE-RELEASE)"
+#define BEAGLE_VERSION  PACKAGE_VERSION  "-dikarya2"
 #define BEAGLE_CITATION "Using BEAGLE library v" BEAGLE_VERSION " for accelerated, parallel likelihood evaluation\n\
 2009-, BEAGLE Working Group - https://beagle-dev.github.io/\n\
 Citation: Ayres et al (2019) Systematic Biology 68: 1052-1061 | doi:10.1093/sysbio/syz020\n"
